# EdgeShield Mesh - Mosquitto ACL Rules

# Topic ACL for Soil Moisture Sensors
pattern readwrite edgeshield/soil-sensor-01/telemetry
pattern readwrite edgeshield/soil-sensor-01/status

# Topic ACL for Weather Station
pattern readwrite edgeshield/weather-station-01/telemetry
pattern readwrite edgeshield/weather-station-01/status

# Topic ACL for Valve Controller
pattern readwrite edgeshield/valve-controller-01/telemetry
pattern readwrite edgeshield/valve-controller-01/status
pattern read edgeshield/valve-controller-01/cmd/#

# Topic ACL for Solar Pump
pattern readwrite edgeshield/solar-pump-01/telemetry
pattern readwrite edgeshield/solar-pump-01/status

# Topic ACL for Greenhouse Monitor
pattern readwrite edgeshield/greenhouse-env-01/telemetry
pattern readwrite edgeshield/greenhouse-env-01/status

# Backend Ingestion Gateway access to all telemetry
pattern read edgeshield/+/telemetry
pattern read edgeshield/+/status
